      "side": 1,
      "message": "Netty\u0027s HttpObjectDecoder also throws TooLongHttpLineException for an over-long chunk-size line (checked on 4.2.16: a chunked POST with a long chunk extension ends up here), so such a request gets 414 URI Too Long although its URI is fine. Could we map it to 414 only when the request is not chunked, for example with a guard on HttpUtil.isTransferEncodingChunked(msg), and add a test for that case?",
